  "title": "RCS vs. iMessage for Business: RBM, Apple Messages for Business, and Unofficial iMessage APIs Compared (2026)",
  "summary": "We compare the three ways businesses use iMessage and RCS in 2026: RCS Business Messaging (the open standard, live on both Android and iPhone), Apple Messages for Business (Apple's official but restrictive channel), and unofficial iMessage APIs (blue-bubble delivery that violates Apple's ToS). Only one is purpose-built for business, sanctioned by carriers, and reaches every device.",
